  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TEA Demonstrator - Clean Energy Partnership between the UK and the Pacific Community (SPC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of the TEA research and innovation Clean Energy Partnership between the UK and the Pacific Community (SPC) to support delivery of the Framework for Energy Security and Resilience in the Pacific (FESRIP) 2021-2030. SPC will implement priority actions identified for the region to build the enabling environment for energy transformation, including development and implementation of robust national energy policies and regulations, capacity development and rectifying gender imbalance in the energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
